 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal with no compatibility artifacts, bodies stay unexposed (`(rfl)` restatements throughout), and each new definition carries its characteristic lemmas with coherent simp annotations, including the function-level coercion bridge the prior round demanded. The separate `IsContinuousRiemannianBundle` instance is required by Mathlib's inference note, and the `@[simp]`-on-`unitSphereIsomHom_smul` objection is correctly refuted by `smul_def`/`unitSphereIsomHom_apply` normalisation.",
